      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing File Retrieval**\n\nI'm now focusing on `fetch_document.py`. My approach involves using `boto3` to interact with DynamoDB via the `database_client` and `database_models`. The key task is to implement fetching a document using its identifier, from the database. This will build on the \"Same-scenario scored files\" implementation I am developing.\n\n\n",
