      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Document Query Logic**\n\nI'm working on `query_documents.py`, focusing on querying documents from DynamoDB using specific field values or partition keys. I'm leveraging `boto3` and helper files to make this happen. The plan is to build the query logic for efficient document retrieval.\n\n\n",
