      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Conditional Update Logic**\n\nI'm currently focused on designing a `conditional_update.py` script. The goal is to implement a robust conditional update to a single document stored in DynamoDB. This script will handle version-aware updates. I'm prioritizing efficient error handling to ensure data integrity during these conditional modifications.\n\n\n",
