        "text": "**Implementing Summarization**\n\nI'm currently working on implementing the \"Later-step scored files\" functionality. Specifically, I'm developing `record_summary.py` to summarize document records using Google Cloud Generative AI (Vertex AI). I'll be leveraging the `google.cloud.aiplatform` SDK for this purpose.\n\n\n",
