        "text": "**Initiating Safety Checks**\n\nI'm now diving into the `record_text_safety.py` file. My focus is on implementing checks for potentially unsafe content within user-generated document fields, leveraging Google Cloud's Vertex AI for Generative AI capabilities. I need to be sure the system handles the complexities of content moderation properly.\n\n\n",
